    "detailed_description": "<strong>Afterland, </strong>a rogue-lite FPS that redefines the genre with its dynamic gameplay and unprecedented variety.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immerse Yourself In the Adventure</strong> </h2>Each game is a unique journey through dozens of dungeons and enemy camps. <br>Prepare to face 40 unique types of enemies and challenge 5 ruthless bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>arm Yourself For Battle </strong></h2></h2></h2>An impressive collection of 35 weapons awaits you, offering infinite strategies to conquer your opponents.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/3c3222558f888d76edc713d8d9d7e01f.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/3c3222558f888d76edc713d8d9d7e01f.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/3c3222558f888d76edc713d8d9d7e01f.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Your Way </strong></h2> Solo or team, cooperative or competitive, Afterland adapts to your playstyle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/de631f204761964e28d6b5ba8b671e78.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/de631f204761964e28d6b5ba8b671e78.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/de631f204761964e28d6b5ba8b671e78.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A constantly Evolving World </strong></h2></h2>As time passes, Afterland transforms. Enemies become stronger, special events emerge, and the map changes, adding a level of complexity and unpredictability to each game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/fa8bec9bdb8de64d0c9af1c73e666fb3.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/fa8bec9bdb8de64d0c9af1c73e666fb3.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/fa8bec9bdb8de64d0c9af1c73e666fb3.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>customize Your Experience </strong></h2></h2>With numerous options to customize your character, you are the master of your own adventure. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/4115bed879a0c3a1aaa53ff2147243be.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/4115bed879a0c3a1aaa53ff2147243be.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/4115bed879a0c3a1aaa53ff2147243be.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Discover Afterland , a world of challenge, discovery, and survival. <br>Are you ready to take up arms?",
    "about_the_game": "<strong>Afterland, </strong>a rogue-lite FPS that redefines the genre with its dynamic gameplay and unprecedented variety.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Immerse Yourself In the Adventure</strong> </h2>Each game is a unique journey through dozens of dungeons and enemy camps. <br>Prepare to face 40 unique types of enemies and challenge 5 ruthless bosses.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>arm Yourself For Battle </strong></h2></h2></h2>An impressive collection of 35 weapons awaits you, offering infinite strategies to conquer your opponents.<br><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/3c3222558f888d76edc713d8d9d7e01f.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/3c3222558f888d76edc713d8d9d7e01f.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/3c3222558f888d76edc713d8d9d7e01f.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play Your Way </strong></h2> Solo or team, cooperative or competitive, Afterland adapts to your playstyle.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/de631f204761964e28d6b5ba8b671e78.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/de631f204761964e28d6b5ba8b671e78.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/de631f204761964e28d6b5ba8b671e78.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A constantly Evolving World </strong></h2></h2>As time passes, Afterland transforms. Enemies become stronger, special events emerge, and the map changes, adding a level of complexity and unpredictability to each game.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/fa8bec9bdb8de64d0c9af1c73e666fb3.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/fa8bec9bdb8de64d0c9af1c73e666fb3.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/fa8bec9bdb8de64d0c9af1c73e666fb3.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>customize Your Experience </strong></h2></h2>With numerous options to customize your character, you are the master of your own adventure. <br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/4115bed879a0c3a1aaa53ff2147243be.poster.avif?t=1689881947\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/4115bed879a0c3a1aaa53ff2147243be.webm?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1491810/extras/4115bed879a0c3a1aaa53ff2147243be.mp4?t=1689881947\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>Discover Afterland , a world of challenge, discovery, and survival. <br>Are you ready to take up arms?",
